    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>General Feat (Prerequisite: Level 4+, Magic Initiate Feat)</em></p><p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Ability Score Increase.</strong> Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p><p><strong>Additional Spells.</strong> Choose a level 1 spell and a level 2 spell from the same list you chose for the cantrips of your Magic Initiate feat. You always have them prepared, and you can cast each once without a spell slot, regaining that use when you finish a Long Rest; you can also cast them with any spell slots of the appropriate level you have. Their spellcasting ability is the one you chose for your Magic Initiate spells.</p><p><strong>Spell Change.</strong> Whenever you gain a level, you can replace one of the spells you chose for this feat with another spell of the same level from the chosen list.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-1LW6ARVpwyKVRUUR\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Pick the spells from the spell list of your Magic Initiate feat, with its spellcasting ability.</p></section>",
